From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: minhmc2007 <quangminh21072010@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 12:25:17 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] minigbm: drop the hbm dependency, hbm is disabled

  error: external/minigbm/Android.bp:284:1: module
  "libminigbm_gralloc_intel" variant "android_vendor_x86_64_shared":
  depends on disabled module "libhbm_minigbm"
  error: external/minigbm/Android.bp:231:1: module "libminigbm_gralloc"
  variant "android_vendor_x86_64_shared": depends on disabled module
  "libhbm_minigbm"

minigbm_cros_gralloc_defaults added shared_libs: ["libhbm_minigbm"]
for x86 and x86_64, and libminigbm_gralloc passed -DDRV_HBM_HELPER on
both. hbm needs ash 0.38+ and this tree has 0.37.3, so every hbm module
is disabled, and soong refuses a live module that depends on a disabled
one.

Both the shared_libs entries and the cflags go, since the flag is what
selects the HBM helper code that needed the library. minigbm was the
only consumer of hbm anywhere in the tree.
---
 Android.bp | 18 ++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index be861f3..8ba40c0 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -127,14 +127,14 @@ cc_defaults {
         "liblog",
         "android.hardware.graphics.common-V7-ndk",
     ],
-    arch: {
-        x86: {
-            shared_libs: ["libhbm_minigbm"],
-        },
-        x86_64: {
-            shared_libs: ["libhbm_minigbm"],
-        },
-    },
+    // The x86/x86_64 shared_libs: ["libhbm_minigbm"] that used to be here is
+    // gone. hbm needs ash 0.38+ and this tree has ash 0.37.3, so the hbm
+    // modules are disabled, and soong rejects a live module that depends on a
+    // disabled one:
+    //   error: module "libminigbm_gralloc" variant "android_vendor_x86_64_shared":
+    //     depends on disabled module "libhbm_minigbm"
+    // The matching -DDRV_HBM_HELPER cflags on libminigbm_gralloc are removed by
+    // the same patch, since the HBM helper code they select is what needed it.
 }
 
 cc_defaults {
@@ -242,7 +242,6 @@ cc_library_shared {
             cflags: [
                 "-DHAS_DMABUF_SYSTEM_HEAP",
                 "-DDRV_AMDGPU",
-                "-DDRV_HBM_HELPER",
                 "-DDRV_I915",
                 "-DDRV_NOUVEAU",
                 "-DDRV_VMWGFX",
@@ -253,7 +252,6 @@ cc_library_shared {
             cflags: [
                 "-DHAS_DMABUF_SYSTEM_HEAP",
                 "-DDRV_AMDGPU",
-                "-DDRV_HBM_HELPER",
                 "-DDRV_I915",
                 "-DDRV_NOUVEAU",
                 "-DDRV_VMWGFX",
